# REQUIRED, and not a copy of the repo-root .dockerignore. That file excludes
# `web/dist/` (build output, gitignored) and `*.md`, and the three COPYs in this
# directory's Dockerfile need web/dist. BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# when it exists and REPLACES the root one, so this file is how the app image
# sees the Emscripten output at all. Without it the `COPY web/dist/` copies
# nothing and the image serves 404s under /live/.
#
# Everything excluded here is either huge, machine-local, or not served.
.git/
mlmp/build/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
